{"c":[{"id":"3ae20362fc05a5eb","sum":"D2-02/B27: HelperOptions.routing absent keeps producers self-triggering (tests, evals); routed producers hold offers, so await routing.idle() then routedSettled. Score B17/B18 memory held-out sets with b27/memsets' relabelled copies (own First/Last name).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T233521Z-ca79b84757c7cc74","text":"D2-02: HelperOptions.routing absent keeps producers self-triggering (tests, producer evals); main.ts routes when Jev is on. Routed producers hold offers (engine.release/dropHeld, openApp.showHeld, events.judge); await routing.idle() then routedSettled.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T235441Z-17480ff5b594d902","text":"B27: B17/B18 memory held-out sets label the user's own First/Last name fields 'none' (written when fill copied values only whole); score them with the relabelled copies in ~/.caret-run/evidence/screen/b27/memsets, whose about-fill-eval accepts expect first/last.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ccba801a8aa9c8ea","sum":"D2-02/B27: Router 1 answers within ~0.05 of its 0.5 floor flip between live runs, so diff runs per moment before crediting a code change; a failed fill reaches the user only via Helper.fillFailed (says.ts fillSays), ids go to warn.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T031924Z-459c6ef9ec89ae5d","text":"D2-02: Router 1 answers within ~0.05 of its 0.5 floor flip between live corpus runs (m02 0.52/0.49, m09 0.45/0.51); diff runs per moment before crediting a code change with a recall move.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T032639Z-5905894b0fafbfcc","text":"B27: a failed fill reaches the user only through Helper.fillFailed (planner/says.ts fillSays); its window and field ids go to warn. Early exits that called this.error published ids until afadd34.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
